      "content": "i mean i get the disclaimer but i cant really get to my doctor tomorrow. the dizziness is making me feel kinda weak and shaky. if i just take an extra pill tonight, wouldn't that just get the levels up faster so my body can handle it? it feels like it would help rather than make it worse.",
